dist/
node_modules/
data/
*.log
# Run artifacts are noise, but the baseline is the recorded expectation the
# suite judges against: without it a fresh clone falls back to counting every
# failure, including the ones a scenario produces on its own a third of the
# time. Excluding the contents rather than the directory is what lets the
# negation work - git does not descend into an excluded directory.
tests/reports/*
!tests/reports/baseline.json
